│ Settings │ Models │ Tools │ Connectors │ Chat              │
│ Clarity · microsoft/clarity-mcp-server (MIT)               │
│ State: declared                                            │
│ Guide                                                      │
│   1. In the Clarity project settings, open Data Export.    │
│   2. Generate a new API token with project admin rights and│
│   copy it.                                                 │
│   3. Put it in secrets.toml under [clarity] as             │
│   CLARITY_API_TOKEN.                                       │
│   Limits of the Clarity API: 10 requests per project per   │
│   day, the last 1 to 3 days only, at most 1,000 rows per   │
│   answer.                                                  │
│   Step by step, in Spanish: docs/conectores.md in the      │
│   repository (last link below).                            │
